1
00:00:03,245 --> 00:00:07,211
Open Reports, Billing and Usage, and AI Usage Analytics.

2
00:00:07,211 --> 00:00:11,242
Choose a Date range, such as the last 30 days, and if you

3
00:00:11,242 --> 00:00:12,969
like, one AI profile.

4
00:00:12,969 --> 00:00:14,377
Then click Show.

5
00:00:14,377 --> 00:00:20,455
The report needs the View AI Chat Analytics permission, the same one as the chat reports.

6
00:00:20,909 --> 00:00:25,645
Metered usage counts every request that was sent to an AI service, one

7
00:00:25,645 --> 00:00:28,386
row for each provider, model and kind:

8
00:00:28,386 --> 00:00:32,000
chat, embeddings, images, speech, or realtime voice.

9
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:37,234
One reply can take several requests, such as searching your knowledge and then

10
00:00:37,234 --> 00:00:40,349
writing the answer, and each one is counted.

11
00:00:40,806 --> 00:00:44,745
Next to the requests are the tokens in and out, and the cached

12
00:00:44,745 --> 00:00:47,990
input, which providers usually bill at a discount.

13
00:00:47,990 --> 00:00:52,972
Reasoning, audio, minutes, characters and images are the other units, and a dash

14
00:00:52,972 --> 00:00:56,100
means that the model is not billed in that unit.

15
00:00:56,100 --> 00:00:59,866
These are the figures to compare with your provider's bill.

16
00:01:00,319 --> 00:01:05,200
Audio usage covers only speech to text and text to speech, with the

17
00:01:05,200 --> 00:01:08,543
hours of audio, the characters and the size.

18
00:01:08,543 --> 00:01:11,619
This site has none, so the page says so.

19
00:01:12,096 --> 00:01:19,416
Chat completions shows the provider calls, the chat sessions, the chat interactions and the total tokens.

20
00:01:19,416 --> 00:01:24,955
The table gives the calls, sessions, input, output and tokens, and the average

21
00:01:24,955 --> 00:01:27,526
latency, for each user and model.

22
00:01:27,979 --> 00:01:31,426
The Voice section covers automated AI phone calls.

23
00:01:31,426 --> 00:01:35,059
It stays empty here, because this site has made none.

